<body>

<header>IP Address Finder / Tracker</header>

<div class="container">
    <p>Click the button below to find your Public IP Address instantly.</p>
    <button onclick="getIPAddress()">Find My IP Address</button>
    <div class="result" id="ipResult"></div>
</div>

<div class="article">
    <h2>About Our IP Address Finder / Tracker Tool</h2>
    <p>Our <strong>IP Address Finder</strong> is a free online tool that lets you quickly find your public IP address. Whether you are troubleshooting network issues, checking your online identity, or need your IP for security purposes, this tool makes it simple and fast.</p>
    <p>By clicking the "Find My IP Address" button, you will instantly get your current public IP address along with its details. This tool is especially useful for network administrators, gamers, and remote workers who need to check connectivity and location details.</p>
